---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Skill 目录 | NVH Test" description="AI Agent Skill 和 MCP 工具目录，收录实用技能包。" current="Skill">
  <section class="hero">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Agent Skills · MCP Tools</p>
      <h1>Skill 目录</h1>
      <p class="lead">收录实用的 AI Agent Skill 和 MCP 工具包，按领域分类。每个条目附来源链接和安装方式。</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button primary" href="#categories">浏览分类</a>
        <a class="button" href="#mcp">MCP 工具</a>
        <a class="button" href="#submit">提交收录</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="hero__panel">
      <div class="metric"><strong>收录</strong><span>持续更新中</span></div>
      <div class="metric"><strong>来源</strong><span>社区贡献 + 精选整理</span></div>
      <div class="metric"><strong>协议</strong><span>MIT / Apache 2.0 / CC-BY-SA</span></div>
      <div class="metric"><strong>未来</strong><span>升级后接入 SkillHub 私有注册中心</span></div>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 自有 Skill ============ -->
  <section class="section" id="own">
    <div class="section__head">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Self-hosted</p><h2>自有 Skill</h2></div>
      <p>本站维护的技能包，部分将在 SkillHub 上线后开源。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">写作</span><h3>writing-system</h3><p>去 AI 味写作系统，三轮独立审稿 + 规则迭代。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">学术</span><h3>sci-search</h3><p>学术论文搜索与引用指标分析。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">学术</span><h3>sci-extract</h3><p>论文全文深度提取与结构化摘要。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">学术</span><h3>sci-figure</h3><p>论文图表自动提取与子图拆分。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">学术</span><h3>sci-polish</h3><p>两阶段论文润色：降 AI 痕迹 + 学术规范。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">学术</span><h3>sci-ppt</h3><p>学术论文转演示文稿。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">学术</span><h3>sci-review</h3><p>审稿意见起草与回复。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">学术</span><h3>sci-html</h3><p>学术演示风格 HTML 幻灯片生成。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">学术</span><h3>sci-zotero</h3><p>Zotero 文献库交互与同步。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">学术</span><h3>sci-download</h3><p>论文 PDF 下载，8 数据源支持。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">创作</span><h3>architecture-diagram</h3><p>暗色主题 SVG 架构图生成。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">创作</span><h3>excalidraw</h3><p>手绘风格 Excalidraw 图表生成。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">创作</span><h3>baoyu-infographic</h3><p>多布局信息图生成（21×21 样式）。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">创作</span><h3>manim-video</h3><p>Manim 数学动画视频制作。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">创作</span><h3>ascii-art</h3><p>ASCII 艺术、cowsay、图片转字符。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">创作</span><h3>p5js</h3><p>p5.js 生成艺术与交互 sketch。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">创作</span><h3>claude-design</h3><p>一次性 HTML 设计产物（落地页/原型）。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">创作</span><h3>comfyui</h3><p>ComfyUI 扩散模型图/视频/音频。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">创作</span><h3>songwriting</h3><p>词曲创作与 Suno AI 音乐生成。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">创作</span><h3>humanizer</h3><p>英文文本去 AI 化（34 条模式检测）。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">命理</span><h3>bazi-ziwei</h3><p>八字 + 紫微斗数 AI 排盘与综合分析。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">财经</span><h3>caijing-studio</h3><p>A 股 + 港股基本面/财报/估值/排雷全套。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">开发</span><h3>agent-skill-creator</h3><p>从工作流描述自动创建 Skill。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">开发</span><h3>hermes-agent</h3><p>Hermes Agent 配置与管理。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">开发</span><h3>claude-code</h3><p>委派 Claude Code CLI 执行编码。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">开发</span><h3>codex</h3><p>委派 OpenAI Codex CLI 执行编码。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">开发</span><h3>github-pr-workflow</h3><p>GitHub PR 全生命周期管理。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">开发</span><h3>github-code-review</h3><p>代码审查与内联评论。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">开发</span><h3>github-issues</h3><p>GitHub Issue 创建、分诊、标签管理。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">开发</span><h3>systematic-debugging</h3><p>4 阶段根因调试方法论。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">开发</span><h3>test-driven-development</h3><p>TDD: RED-GREEN-REFACTOR 强制执行。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">开发</span><h3>simplify-code</h3><p>4 代理并行代码精简。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">开发</span><h3>browser-automation-cdp</h3><p>浏览器自动化转 CDP 无头执行。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">开发</span><h3>server-admin</h3><p>服务器运维：磁盘、缓存、Docker。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">开发</span><h3>plan</h3><p>Markdown 计划编写与跟踪。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">开发</span><h3>spike</h3><p>一次性验证实验。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">开发</span><h3>dogfood</h3><p>探索性 QA 测试与 Bug 报告。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">效率</span><h3>docx</h3><p>Word 文档创建与编辑。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">效率</span><h3>powerpoint</h3><p>PPT 幻灯片创建与编辑。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">效率</span><h3>pdf</h3><p>PDF 创建、合并、拆分、加密。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">效率</span><h3>xlsx</h3><p>Excel 电子表格与 CSV 处理。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">效率</span><h3>ocr-and-documents</h3><p>PDF/扫描件文字提取（pymupdf、marker）。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">效率</span><h3>google-workspace</h3><p>Gmail、日历、Drive、Docs、Sheets。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">效率</span><h3>maps</h3><p>地理编码、POI、路线规划。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">效率</span><h3>airtable</h3><p>Airtable REST API 操作。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">效率</span><h3>notion</h3><p>Notion API 页面、数据库、Markdown。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">效率</span><h3>obsidian</h3><p>Obsidian 笔记库读写搜索。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">效率</span><h3>himalaya</h3><p>终端 IMAP/SMTP 邮件客户端。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">媒体</span><h3>youtube-content</h3><p>YouTube 字幕转摘要、博客、线程。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">媒体</span><h3>gif-search</h3><p>Tenor GIF 搜索与下载。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">媒体</span><h3>songsee</h3><p>音频频谱与特征分析。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">研究</span><h3>arxiv</h3><p>arXiv 论文按关键词/作者/分类搜索。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">研究</span><h3>blogwatcher</h3><p>博客与 RSS/Atom 订阅监控。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">研究</span><h3>polymarket</h3><p>Polymarket 市场行情查询。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">研究</span><h3>llm-wiki</h3><p>Karpathy LLM Wiki 查询。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">AI</span><h3>huggingface-hub</h3><p>HuggingFace 模型/数据集搜索下载。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">AI</span><h3>llama-cpp</h3><p>llama.cpp 本地 GGUF 推理。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">AI</span><h3>serving-llms-vllm</h3><p>vLLM 高吞吐 LLM 推理服务。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">AI</span><h3>evaluating-llms-harness</h3><p>lm-eval-harness LLM 基准测试。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">AI</span><h3>weights-and-biases</h3><p>W&B 实验跟踪与模型注册。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">社交</span><h3>xurl</h3><p>X/Twitter 推文搜索、发布、DM。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">家居</span><h3>openhue</h3><p>Philips Hue 灯光场景控制。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">设计</span><h3>tufte-data-viz</h3><p>Tufte 风格数据可视化图表。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">设计</span><h3>pretext</h3><p>DOM 自由文本布局创意演示。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">设计</span><h3>sketch</h3><p>一次性 HTML 设计对比方案。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">设计</span><h3>popular-web-designs</h3><p>54 套真实设计系统参考。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">设计</span><h3>design-md</h3><p>Google DESIGN.md token 规范。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">设计</span><h3>nano-pdf</h3><p>自然语言编辑 PDF 文字。</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 社区精选 ============ -->
  <section class="section" id="categories">
    <div class="section__head">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Community</p><h2>社区精选</h2></div>
      <p>来自 openclaw、awesome-copilot、mercury-agent-skills 等社区的高质量 Skill。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">效率</span><h3>diagram-maker</h3><p>图表制作工具。来源：openclaw</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">效率</span><h3>documentation-writer</h3><p>技术文档写作辅助。来源：awesome-copilot</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">学习</span><h3>ai-claim-checker</h3><p>AI 生成内容声明检测。来源：education-agent-skills</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">学习</span><h3>exam-ready</h3><p>考试备考辅助。来源：awesome-copilot</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">个人</span><h3>daily-standup-journal</h3><p>每日站会日志。来源：mercury-agent-skills</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">个人</span><h3>decision-matrix</h3><p>决策矩阵分析。来源：mercury-agent-skills</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ MCP 工具 ============ -->
  <section class="section" id="mcp">
    <div class="section__head">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">MCP Server</p><h2>MCP 工具</h2></div>
      <p>Model Context Protocol 工具，Agent 运行时动态调用。与 Skill 互补。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">文件系统</span><h3>filesystem</h3><p>文件读写与目录操作。官方 MCP server。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">文件系统</span><h3>git</h3><p>Git 仓库操作。官方 MCP server。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">搜索</span><h3>brave-search</h3><p>Brave 搜索引擎 API。官方 MCP server。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">搜索</span><h3>fetch</h3><p>网页抓取与转换。官方 MCP server。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">数据库</span><h3>postgres</h3><p>PostgreSQL 查询。官方 MCP server。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">数据库</span><h3>sqlite</h3><p>SQLite 数据库操作。官方 MCP server。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">自动化</span><h3>playwright</h3><p>浏览器自动化。社区维护。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">自动化</span><h3>computer-use</h3><p>桌面操作自动化。社区维护。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">NVH 专用</span><h3>signal-processor</h3><p>信号处理（FFT/阶次/包络）。规划中。</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="badge">NVH 专用</span><h3>data-visualizer</h3><p>NVH 数据可视化。规划中。</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 提交收录 ============ -->
  <section class="section" id="submit">
    <div class="section__head">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Contribute</p><h2>提交收录</h2></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge">方式一</span>
        <h3>GitHub PR</h3>
        <p>Fork 仓库，在 catalog 中添加你的 Skill，提交 PR 即可。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge">方式二</span>
        <h3>SkillHub CLI</h3>
        <p>SkillHub 上线后，通过 CLI 一键发布：<code>skillhub publish</code></p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge">方式三</span>
        <h3>Issue 推荐</h3>
        <p>在 GitHub Issue 中推荐你觉得好用的 Skill，我们审核后收录。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge">说明</span>
        <h3>收录标准</h3>
        <p>开源协议（MIT/Apache 2.0）、可复现、有文档、实际可用。</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 路线图 ============ -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="section__head">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Roadmap</p><h2>发展路线</h2></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge">Phase 1</span>
        <h3>静态目录页</h3>
        <p>✅ 当前阶段。在 NVH 站点维护 Skill 和 MCP 目录，手动整理收录。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge">Phase 2</span>
        <h3>SkillHub 部署</h3>
        <p>VPS 升级后部署讯飞 SkillHub，支持搜索、发布、版本管理和 CLI 安装。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="badge">Phase 3</span>
        <h3>社区运营</h3>
        <p>开放注册，团队命名空间，审核工作流，打造 NVH + AI 工具 Skill 社区。</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
